(993128,34,38,11,6,'I will no longer have pity on the people of this earth, says the'),
(993129,34,38,11,7,'So I shepherded the flock of slaughter for the sheep-merchants. I took two staffs: one I called Mercy and the other I called Union. So I shepherded the sheep.'),
